# Two hours awake, lid closed included: into the bag, still running, and still
# counting down when it comes out.
clock 14:30 · battery 88 · floor 15

$ awake 2h
caption "Two hours awake, lid closed included."
lid close
time +1h10m · battery 71
caption "In the bag, still running."
lid open
$ awake status
caption "Fifty minutes left, right where you left it."
